Sun Sep 27 17:54:59 UTC 2026 - Dirk Müller <dmueller@suse.com>

- update to 0.78.0:
  ### Security Advisories
  * GHSA-6542-g6qc-gj95
  * GHSA-7cwr-ghvv-24jf
  * GHSA-222m-44fg-jx8g
  * GHSA-8r33-hr9m-69wh
  * GHSA-wjv5-93q3-xm73
  * (tool-sandbox)* Fall back to the interpreter's directory for
    RPATH-less ELF dependencies (#1650)
  * Preserve query string on jwt-bearer token_url
  * Pass through AF_UNIX traffic in proxy-only mode
  * Tolerate volatile process-relative aliases in --self
    reload
  * Stop save-prompt failures from overriding the child
    exit code
  * Harden calculate_dir_size against silent errors and
    symlink cycles
  * Reject . and .. in pack namespace and name
  * Fail closed when upstream DNS returns no addresses

